{"id":"n14913-1-5","stage":4,"title":"되돌아보다 · 再回首","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14913-1-5-1","ko":"왜 자꾸 스쳐 지나간 사람을 되돌아봐?","zh":"为什么总是回头看那些只是擦肩而过的人？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"스쳐","meaning":"擦过，掠过","explanation":"스치다：擦过，掠过；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"스치다","audio":"/audio/1e704b94c38e668979f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15831","senseId":"1","lemma":"스치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지나간","meaning":"通过，路过","explanation":"지나가다：通过，路过；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"지나가다","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60216","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람을","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되돌아봐?","meaning":"再回首，回头看","explanation":"되돌아보다：再回首，回头看；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되돌아보다","audio":"/audio/80d942b7d4a40359819e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14913","senseId":"1","lemma":"되돌아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"1e704b94c38e6689","term":"스치다","zh":"擦过，掠过","audio":"/audio/1e704b94c38e668979f4.mp3","entryId":"15831","definition":"轻轻擦到或好像要碰到一样近距离经过。","pronunciation":["스치다"]},{"id":"9c25392f9bf0bb82","term":"지나가다","zh":"通过，路过","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3","entryId":"60216","definition":"经过某个地方。","pronunciation":["지나가다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"80d942b7d4a40359","term":"되돌아보다","zh":"再回首，回头看","audio":"/audio/80d942b7d4a40359819e.mp3","entryId":"14913","definition":"转头向后再次看已看过的东西。","pronunciation":["되도라보다","뒈도라보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7a7a839ab0b324110363.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14913-1-5-2","ko":"내가 아는 사람 같아서.","zh":"因为我觉得他好像是我认识的人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아는","meaning":"认识，相识","explanation":"알다：认识，相识；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"10","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아서.","meaning":"十足的，真是个","explanation":"같다：十足的，真是个；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"7","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"认识，相识","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"以前见过，或有过交流而亲密往来。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"十足的，真是个","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"(骂语)表示和前面说的没有两样。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/805c370de3d000bb4e9a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.773,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14913","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":134,"sequenceScore":2.5997,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为我觉得他好像是我认识的人。","为什么总是回头看那些只是擦肩而过的人？","泡菜好像还没发酵好？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["为什么总是回头看那些只是擦肩而过的人？","泡菜好像还没发酵好？","因为我觉得他好像是我认识的人。"],"answer":2}]}
